WEBVTT

01:26.060 --> 01:31.610
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.580
[Episode 20: Huairou, the Murderer?]

02:04.710 --> 02:05.796
Don't worry.

02:05.820 --> 02:07.156
I'll investigate the matter for you later

02:07.180 --> 02:07.826
to see whether Sheriff Liu

02:07.850 --> 02:09.926
perished on duty at the frontline at Fujian.

02:09.950 --> 02:11.800
It's no use to identify the exploited ones.

02:12.640 --> 02:15.546
I'm looking for the mastermind.

02:15.570 --> 02:17.536
Then why are you leaving in a hurry?

02:17.560 --> 02:19.270
Tang Xiao is cornered now.

02:19.270 --> 02:20.276
Once you push him again,

02:20.300 --> 02:22.130
he will surely tell the truth.

02:22.250 --> 02:23.770
He has already pleaded guilty.

02:24.390 --> 02:25.840
There's no need to interrogate him anymore.

02:28.930 --> 02:32.359
If Tang Xiao had nothing to do with the case,

02:33.300 --> 02:36.790
why would he know so much about the details?

02:39.420 --> 02:42.290
Tang Xiao cares so much about Sheriff Liu

02:42.380 --> 02:43.926
only because

02:43.950 --> 02:45.960
he wants to do away with the witness.

02:46.330 --> 02:47.780
Does that mean

02:48.310 --> 02:49.960
Tang Xiao is the mastermind?

02:50.190 --> 02:52.859
He is just a guard dog.

02:54.140 --> 02:55.436
Did you keep him alive

02:55.460 --> 02:57.970
to lure out the person behind him?

03:00.250 --> 03:01.700
I shall not have the chance.

03:01.910 --> 03:04.750
I think someone will shut him up soon.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.736
Fine.

03:06.760 --> 03:08.386
I'd give you the shirt off my back.

03:08.410 --> 03:10.500
I'll ask the Shadowman to keep an eye on Tang Xiao.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.130
Thank you, Mr. Mo.

03:18.330 --> 03:21.040
Did you come back in a hurry

03:21.150 --> 03:23.100
to confront the Su family?

03:23.780 --> 03:26.236
At this point, I have no way back anymore.

03:26.260 --> 03:28.010
I can only get to the bottom of the case

03:28.240 --> 03:30.240
by investigating all the guilty ones.

03:30.430 --> 03:31.956
With the benefit of hindsight,

03:31.980 --> 03:34.326
the news of the Imperial Court unbanning on maritime trade

03:34.350 --> 03:36.766
was indeed from Su Linghe.

03:36.790 --> 03:39.230
That caused the dispute when purchasing land on the east coast.

03:39.969 --> 03:42.126
But you've been supporting

03:42.150 --> 03:44.556
the Su family with all your heart.

03:44.580 --> 03:46.660
Do you really want to destroy it personally?

03:51.150 --> 03:52.670
Whether it is destroyed or kept

03:53.960 --> 03:56.046
depends on whether it is guilty or not.

03:56.070 --> 03:59.510
You only care about the truth.

04:00.430 --> 04:01.970
Is it worth it?

04:05.080 --> 04:10.260
Heed not to the tree-rustling and leaf-lashing rain.

04:11.320 --> 04:16.790
Why not stroll along, whistle, and sing under its rein?

04:19.099 --> 04:23.940
Lighter and better suited than horses are straw sandals and a bamboo staff.

04:24.670 --> 04:26.120
Who's afraid?

04:26.290 --> 04:32.290
A palm-leaf plaited cape provides enough for misty weather in life sustain.

04:33.970 --> 04:39.340
Lighter and better suited than horses are straw sandals and a bamboo staff.

04:39.790 --> 04:41.550
Who's afraid?

04:42.470 --> 04:47.900
A palm-leaf plaited cape provides enough for misty weather in life sustain.

04:53.770 --> 04:58.860
A palm-leaf plaited cape provides enough for misty weather in life sustain.

05:00.430 --> 05:05.960
The rain has melted the clouds and dispersed the mists.

05:07.440 --> 05:09.020
Seeking the truth

05:10.690 --> 05:13.260
is my only purpose in this world.

05:14.030 --> 05:16.320
But if there were no justice in the world,

05:18.670 --> 05:20.380
wouldn't it be even more absurd?

05:40.790 --> 05:43.790
The world is full of absurdity from the very start.

05:43.900 --> 05:45.806
With your own power,

05:45.830 --> 05:48.150
how much justice can you achieve?

05:49.510 --> 05:51.480
They all say I dare not gamble.

05:51.670 --> 05:53.116
Perhaps...

05:53.140 --> 05:55.260
this is my biggest bet.

05:57.880 --> 06:01.430
If I don't make the sacrifice, who else will?

06:10.440 --> 06:14.310
Looking back over the bleak passage survived.

06:14.940 --> 06:20.730
Shall not be affected by windswept rain or shine.

06:48.060 --> 06:50.286
This hairpin shouldn't be worth much.

06:50.310 --> 06:52.000
You've been staring at it for a long time.

06:52.670 --> 06:54.450
Your sword is worthless too.

06:55.070 --> 06:57.450
This was left to me by my foster father.

07:00.020 --> 07:02.990
This is also the only thing my mother gave me.

07:07.120 --> 07:09.990
The Shu family was rich and influential back then.

07:10.220 --> 07:12.220
Why were your parents so stingy?

07:13.790 --> 07:15.240
No.

07:15.300 --> 07:16.750
I mean

07:16.850 --> 07:18.900
this is the only thing left.

07:36.510 --> 07:38.240
Why is Mr. Mo here too?

07:41.140 --> 07:43.166
Don't mention what we talked about in front of them.

07:43.190 --> 07:43.946
Sure.

07:43.970 --> 07:46.110
Let's talk about us then.

07:46.330 --> 07:47.756
Tang Xiao compensated me.

07:47.780 --> 07:49.646
But then, Liansheng House utilized my money to make their accounts balanced.

07:49.670 --> 07:51.786
What did I get in return after all of these?

07:51.810 --> 07:53.946
I promised to give you all the Tang family's property.

07:53.970 --> 07:54.996
There are over ten gambling houses.

07:55.020 --> 07:56.656
Have you ever calculated how much money they are worth?

07:56.680 --> 07:58.216
How can I get them? Tell me.

07:58.240 --> 07:59.880
I have my own plan.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.766
Are you hurt?

08:05.790 --> 08:07.240
It's not a big deal.

08:08.030 --> 08:09.550
Why don't you ask me?

08:10.710 --> 08:11.896
How the top 1 swordsman in Jiangnan

08:11.920 --> 08:13.266
could have lost to a Japanese?

08:13.290 --> 08:14.426
Cut it out.

08:14.450 --> 08:15.486
Let me ask you.

08:15.510 --> 08:18.150
Is Tang Xiao still alive?

08:18.450 --> 08:19.900
Yes.

08:20.710 --> 08:22.160
Or not.

08:25.030 --> 08:26.156
Yanan,

08:26.180 --> 08:28.366
go back hurriedly to the city with Jin and Mr. Mo.

08:28.390 --> 08:30.006
I have something to deal with.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.126
Where are you going?

08:31.150 --> 08:32.600
Are you going alone?

08:32.640 --> 08:35.120
Don't worry. It won't be dangerous.

08:57.660 --> 08:59.830
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

09:05.710 --> 09:07.160
Mr. Qian.

09:09.230 --> 09:10.680
Mr. Yun.

09:11.220 --> 09:13.926
May I have a look

09:13.950 --> 09:16.180
at the transaction records of the Chamber of Commerce?

09:19.700 --> 09:20.866
Why?

09:20.890 --> 09:22.660
Do you need to report to Chairman Su?

09:23.440 --> 09:24.890
No need.

09:24.980 --> 09:26.946
The chairman said in particular that

09:26.970 --> 09:28.196
as long as you need,

09:28.220 --> 09:30.360
the Chamber of Commerce will fully support you.

09:31.070 --> 09:32.520
I appreciate that.

09:44.390 --> 09:46.990
If I guess it right,

09:47.350 --> 09:51.150
you're looking for the files of Tang's Gambling House,

09:52.310 --> 09:53.760
aren't you?

09:58.150 --> 09:59.366
Sir,

09:59.390 --> 10:01.390
this time you turned the table

10:01.900 --> 10:04.140
in the bet with Tang Xiao.

10:04.530 --> 10:06.770
I admire you very much for that.

10:06.830 --> 10:08.280
It was impressive.

10:08.970 --> 10:12.100
However, even if you have won,

10:12.300 --> 10:14.700
neither you gained any benefits from the victory,

10:14.990 --> 10:17.350
nor Tang Xiao had a great loss.

10:17.530 --> 10:21.750
So I guess the game is not over yet.

10:22.030 --> 10:24.296
You still have a backup plan.

10:24.320 --> 10:25.980
If possible,

10:26.160 --> 10:27.860
can you disclose the details to me?

10:27.950 --> 10:31.510
My lady is also very interested in this.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.200
I'm not here for Tang Xiao.

10:36.900 --> 10:38.316
Mr. Qian.

10:38.340 --> 10:39.146
Could you please

10:39.170 --> 10:41.266
help me retrieve all records

10:41.290 --> 10:43.070
under the Chamber of Commerce in the 24th year of Tianqing?

10:43.830 --> 10:45.870
In the 24th year of Tianqing?

10:46.280 --> 10:47.310
Why are you looking for

10:47.310 --> 10:49.870
the old files from more than ten years ago?

10:57.160 --> 10:58.610
Come with me.

11:13.270 --> 11:14.720
Are these all of them?

11:15.710 --> 11:17.830
Which kind of transaction are you looking for?

11:17.870 --> 11:18.956
I'll help you find them.

11:18.980 --> 11:21.150
Don't bother. I can do it myself.

11:23.390 --> 11:24.686
Take your time.

11:24.710 --> 11:25.726
I'll wait for you outside.

11:25.750 --> 11:27.200
Thank you.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.550
[May 4, the 24th year of Tianqing]

12:11.390 --> 12:14.300
Anyone involved will have to pay the price.

12:14.350 --> 12:16.536
If you have the means to manipulate Tang Xiao

12:16.560 --> 12:17.506
and track him down

12:17.530 --> 12:19.680
by following the clues,

12:19.830 --> 12:21.486
the truth of the Luo family's village killings

12:21.510 --> 12:23.620
will surely come to light.

12:30.110 --> 12:31.560
Regarding this issue,

12:31.790 --> 12:33.820
you have to ask your close friend,

12:34.560 --> 12:39.460
the other owner of the Lianfang House, Su Mingyu.

12:43.700 --> 12:46.256
You intend to find out the truth about the Luo family's village killings.

12:46.280 --> 12:48.006
But before that, you will have

12:48.030 --> 12:50.546
turned Nandu City upside down.

12:50.570 --> 12:53.026
The truth you've waited for 15 years

12:53.050 --> 12:55.106
is much more unbearable than you thought.

12:55.130 --> 12:57.250
Do you understand now?

12:59.630 --> 13:01.066
Tell me first.

13:01.090 --> 13:02.990
How far you'll go in the investigation?

13:03.740 --> 13:05.300
Anyone who gets involved

13:06.030 --> 13:07.570
will have to pay the price.

13:11.730 --> 13:13.026
It's been so long.

13:13.050 --> 13:16.110
You only care about the truth.

13:16.300 --> 13:17.750
Is it worth it?

13:18.620 --> 13:20.470
If there were no justice in this world,

13:20.900 --> 13:22.426
wouldn't it be even more absurd?

13:22.450 --> 13:24.306
With your own power,

13:24.330 --> 13:26.410
how much justice can you achieve?

13:26.830 --> 13:30.030
If I don't make the sacrifice, who else will?

14:01.410 --> 14:02.860
Miss Ke.

14:04.200 --> 14:06.180
Without the Elevation Certificate,

14:06.380 --> 14:10.070
no matter how much you and Mingyu love each other,

14:10.930 --> 14:14.390
the Imperial Court's legislation will not allow him

14:14.590 --> 14:16.790
to marry you into the Su family.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.890
Miss Su.

14:22.480 --> 14:25.150
From the moment I burned the document,

14:25.470 --> 14:26.970
I figured it out.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.150
Rather than saying

14:29.380 --> 14:32.130
I burned the chance for me to be unenslaved,

14:34.500 --> 14:37.430
I'd say I burned

14:38.190 --> 14:40.620
the shackles that had locked me up for years.

14:41.730 --> 14:43.510
If I always feel inferior and humble,

14:43.850 --> 14:45.880
even if I am unenslaved,

14:48.660 --> 14:51.330
I will still be troubled because of being a sinner's daughter.

14:55.930 --> 14:57.380
Sister,

14:58.300 --> 14:59.940
without the document,

15:01.420 --> 15:03.670
can't we really be together forever?

15:23.450 --> 15:26.290
I have seen the prosperity of the world

15:27.620 --> 15:29.300
and experienced the fickleness of human nature.

15:31.470 --> 15:33.510
Now I just want to live in the present.

15:34.230 --> 15:37.630
I don't want to leave any regrets in this life.

15:38.350 --> 15:40.030
As for the legal status,

15:41.280 --> 15:42.730
it doesn't matter to me.

15:43.900 --> 15:45.350
I don't want it.

15:58.600 --> 16:02.180
Since you don't care about

16:03.400 --> 16:05.130
the common customs and the legislations,

16:07.350 --> 16:09.110
I won't

16:10.670 --> 16:12.590
make arrangements for your wedding then.

16:18.110 --> 16:20.470
Thank you for fulfilling our wishes.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.930
Thank you, miss.

16:27.560 --> 16:28.926
Rong,

16:28.950 --> 16:31.696
why were you in such a hurry?

16:31.720 --> 16:33.446
When the Chamber of Commerce was closing,

16:33.470 --> 16:35.190
Xiang suddenly came.

16:35.260 --> 16:38.116
He insisted on reviewing the business deed files.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.820
He requested to check on the files in the 24th year of Tianqing.

16:42.370 --> 16:44.150
So what do you think

16:45.260 --> 16:47.090
he is up to?

16:50.850 --> 16:52.300
Rong.

16:54.380 --> 16:56.100
The trend is changing like the tides.

16:56.790 --> 16:59.160
If the Su family were no longer prosperous,

17:00.110 --> 17:01.740
what would you think?

18:03.650 --> 18:04.976
Open the door.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.126
Hurry up!

18:06.150 --> 18:08.476
Open the door!

18:08.500 --> 18:09.950
Open the door!

18:10.800 --> 18:13.006
Leave me alone. Close the door.

18:13.030 --> 18:14.650
Close the door.

18:35.740 --> 18:38.000
Mr. Tang is finally back.

18:38.750 --> 18:40.376
You work for Mr. Ye?

18:40.400 --> 18:41.446
Guess again.

18:41.470 --> 18:43.880
Are you from that side?

18:45.080 --> 18:46.650
Which side?

18:50.800 --> 18:52.976
Why don't you just tell me your identity?

18:53.000 --> 18:55.090
Why did you break into my mansion?

18:56.500 --> 19:00.030
Mr. Tang, you've cooked the books, haven't you?

18:57.510 --> 18:59.430
[Account Book]

19:00.500 --> 19:02.360
Although I don't quite understand the content,

19:02.450 --> 19:04.876
the texture of these account books is similar to the new ones.

19:04.900 --> 19:07.816
I can smell the paper mulberry scent once I open them.

19:07.840 --> 19:09.566
You didn't even tell me who you are.

19:09.590 --> 19:10.590
Yet you are asking questions about this and that.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.350
On what ground should I tell you?

19:11.350 --> 19:12.800
Fine.

19:16.510 --> 19:18.240
Tell him then.

19:24.930 --> 19:25.956
Mr. Ye.

19:25.980 --> 19:28.186
This is the young master of the Lingyuan Sect,

19:27.920 --> 19:30.920
[The Young Master of the Lingyuan Sect, Kou Yuanjie]

19:28.210 --> 19:29.840
Kou Yuanjie.

19:32.480 --> 19:34.800
Pardon my ignorance.

19:35.680 --> 19:37.336
Greetings, Young Master.

19:37.360 --> 19:39.726
Now, tell me the whole story.

19:39.750 --> 19:41.550
Why did you cook the books?

19:45.640 --> 19:47.440
Don't be so aggressive.

19:48.350 --> 19:49.416
All these years, Mr. Tang

19:49.440 --> 19:51.790
has laundered that much money for the Lingyuan Sect.

19:51.970 --> 19:55.406
He should be rewarded for his hard work.

19:55.430 --> 19:56.326
Mr. Tang,

19:56.350 --> 19:58.780
let me have a look at the treasure in your cellar.

20:20.750 --> 20:22.196
Mr. Ye,

20:22.220 --> 20:26.180
I've spent tens of years on the pharmacopoeia.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.540
[Pharmacopoeia]

20:27.270 --> 20:30.206
Every prescription inside has gone through multi-party verification.

20:30.230 --> 20:32.266
It's really valuable.

20:32.290 --> 20:33.976
I am honoured to present it to you and Young Master

20:34.000 --> 20:38.096
as well as the Lingyuan Sect.

20:38.120 --> 20:41.326
Every ingredient here is a rare treasure.

20:41.350 --> 20:43.470
They are all priceless.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.640
Mr. Tang,

20:47.430 --> 20:49.756
how many tricks did you use

20:49.780 --> 20:51.806
in the accounting

20:51.830 --> 20:54.510
and how much money did you embezzle from the Lingyuan Sect

20:54.510 --> 20:57.190
to get such an account book?

20:58.590 --> 21:00.230
Mr. Ye.

21:00.590 --> 21:02.310
At this point,

21:02.380 --> 21:06.020
I d-don't dare to make such jokes.

21:09.150 --> 21:10.600
Really?

21:32.750 --> 21:34.800
Mr. Tang's collection

21:35.030 --> 21:36.756
can already offset the interest.

21:36.780 --> 21:38.260
It's more than enough.

21:40.060 --> 21:41.510
Come here.

21:48.350 --> 21:50.166
P-Please spare my life.

21:50.190 --> 21:51.640
Young Master.

21:52.100 --> 21:52.916
Please spare my life.

21:52.940 --> 21:54.390
Tang Xiao.

21:54.550 --> 21:56.526
Do you know what you did wrong?

21:56.550 --> 21:59.166
Stealing money and cooking the books.

21:59.190 --> 22:00.566
No.

22:00.590 --> 22:03.746
It's fine to embezzle money and cook the books,

22:03.770 --> 22:06.400
but it's your fault for being discovered by me.

22:06.630 --> 22:08.040
It's the same as you acted on your own

22:08.060 --> 22:10.186
to deal with Xiang.

22:10.210 --> 22:12.610
Your mistake was losing to him.

22:13.010 --> 22:14.526
I've always been tolerant,

22:14.550 --> 22:17.536
but I can't stand your failure.

22:17.560 --> 22:19.786
I... I was wrong. I admit my mistakes.

22:19.810 --> 22:21.260
Please.

22:22.040 --> 22:24.810
Give me one last chance.

22:24.910 --> 22:26.116
Fine.

22:26.140 --> 22:28.030
I'll give you one chance.

22:40.220 --> 22:41.670
Mr. Tang,

22:41.870 --> 22:44.326
if you can't even defeat a few women,

22:44.350 --> 22:46.080
you can't blame me for being merciless.

23:04.740 --> 23:05.786
Mr. Mo has given an order.

23:05.810 --> 23:07.596
Someone will visit Tang Xiao today.

23:07.620 --> 23:08.686
Do keep an eye on him.

23:08.710 --> 23:10.460
Do we have to keep Tang Xiao safe?

23:10.590 --> 23:12.366
Tang Xiao's life is of no great importance.

23:12.390 --> 23:13.926
You must pay attention to the visitors.

23:13.950 --> 23:15.400
Understood.

23:15.430 --> 23:17.126
Chong is in the northwest corner.

23:17.150 --> 23:19.030
You can find him on the roof.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.970
Yes, sir. I'll pass him the order.

23:40.050 --> 23:41.500
Chong.

23:51.590 --> 23:54.820
[Bi Yuewu, Lingyuan]

24:18.870 --> 24:20.320
How is it?

24:20.350 --> 24:21.800
It's cleared now.

24:22.660 --> 24:24.446
Yuewu is indeed more reliable.

24:24.470 --> 24:25.646
As long as I can help you,

24:25.670 --> 24:27.170
I'm willing to do anything.

24:28.910 --> 24:31.230
I like you being obedient and sensible.

24:32.100 --> 24:33.550
Ye Xiao.

24:33.770 --> 24:36.600
You've been following me since I first entered Nandu City.

24:36.820 --> 24:38.916
Are you here to help me

24:38.940 --> 24:41.590
or monitor me on behalf of Chief Nangong?

24:44.220 --> 24:45.670
You have misunderstood me.

24:58.390 --> 24:59.886
The 105,000 taels

24:59.910 --> 25:01.846
is the emergency fund of our sect.

25:01.870 --> 25:03.940
Now you have trusted Tang Xiao, the wrong person.

25:04.000 --> 25:05.650
How do you plan to make it up?

25:05.700 --> 25:07.566
Young Master, please spare me some time.

25:07.590 --> 25:08.766
I will solve it in my own way.

25:08.790 --> 25:10.240
Your own way?

25:10.350 --> 25:12.350
It's one of Nangong Fang's tricks again.

25:12.350 --> 25:15.190
Although Tang Xiao died, the gambling house is still there.

25:15.790 --> 25:16.500
If we take advantage of him...

25:16.520 --> 25:17.970
Enough.

25:21.490 --> 25:23.766
Gather all your men.

25:23.790 --> 25:26.316
Tonight, I'll teach you a lesson

25:26.340 --> 25:29.560
about how the Lingyuan Sect would act.

25:29.770 --> 25:33.650
[Nangong's Residence, Lingyuan]

25:37.020 --> 25:38.006
Sir,

25:38.030 --> 25:40.230
Mr. Ye from Nandu sent a letter using the pigeon.

25:40.950 --> 25:41.366
Read it.

25:41.390 --> 25:42.836
Tang Xiao embezzled the money of the sect

25:42.860 --> 25:44.740
and failed in the bet with Xiang.

25:45.660 --> 25:46.866
So the young master went to Nandu

25:46.890 --> 25:48.006
to kill Tang Xiao.

25:48.030 --> 25:49.490
He hoped that you could make the final decision.

25:54.490 --> 25:57.630
[Nangong Fang, Lingyuan]

26:00.810 --> 26:02.400
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

26:10.300 --> 26:11.750
Look.

26:12.110 --> 26:13.766
Mr. Yun is still in the archive room.

26:13.790 --> 26:15.046
Don't tell me he is sleeping there.

26:15.070 --> 26:15.886
Go and have a look.

26:15.910 --> 26:17.510
Be careful not to knock over the oil lamp.

26:18.650 --> 26:20.100
Mr. Yun,

26:20.340 --> 26:22.006
you can't take the files away from the Chamber of Commerce.

26:22.030 --> 26:23.830
Unless you get the chairman's approval.

26:30.550 --> 26:32.770
I'm going to visit her now.

27:00.180 --> 27:01.716
You came in a hurry.

27:01.740 --> 27:04.120
It seemed like you had something urgent to deal with.

27:04.570 --> 27:06.950
But why are you so silent now?

27:07.640 --> 27:10.050
Why don't you sit down and have some tea?

27:10.320 --> 27:12.686
Take your time and tell us the story.

27:12.710 --> 27:16.070
I guess Chairman Su may have something to say.

27:20.670 --> 27:21.806
Mr. Yun,

27:21.830 --> 27:23.386
we're now in the hottest period of the summer.

27:23.410 --> 27:24.676
It is hot and humid.

27:24.700 --> 27:27.080
You might be prone to lose your cool.

27:27.570 --> 27:30.400
You'd better calm yourself down.

27:31.550 --> 27:33.590
I don't need to calm down.

27:35.350 --> 27:37.026
I want to take a drastic measure instead.

27:37.050 --> 27:38.500
If too drastic,

27:39.220 --> 27:42.200
it'll not only harm your enemy but also you yourself.

27:42.350 --> 27:46.790
So it's not worth it.

27:46.910 --> 27:48.630
You are not me.

27:49.800 --> 27:51.630
How do you know whether it's worth it to me or not?

27:52.790 --> 27:57.330
I have some past stories to discuss with Mr. Yun.

28:01.070 --> 28:03.110
Go ahead. It's fine.

28:34.060 --> 28:38.090
[Records of Land Purchase on the East Coast in the 24th year of Tianqing]

28:38.300 --> 28:39.750
That's right.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.960
As recorded in the file,

28:42.870 --> 28:44.796
the Su family

28:44.820 --> 28:47.570
caused the dispute about the land purchase on the east coast.

28:47.670 --> 28:50.066
But back then, my late father

28:50.090 --> 28:52.290
didn't do that for his own benefit.

28:52.940 --> 28:54.610
He had no choice

28:55.060 --> 28:56.226
but to protect himself.

28:56.250 --> 28:57.760
What do you mean?

28:59.660 --> 29:01.146
In the 20th year of Tianqing,

29:01.170 --> 29:04.300
Wen Cong barged into Nandu alone.

29:04.790 --> 29:07.510
In just a few years, he created chaos

29:07.770 --> 29:10.946
among the Nandu merchants with his own strength.

29:10.970 --> 29:13.720
The rich merchants in Nandu were all defeated.

29:14.670 --> 29:17.680
The Nandu Chamber of Commerce was nearly falling apart.

29:18.660 --> 29:20.460
I knew about it already.

29:22.270 --> 29:24.080
You only know the parts,

29:24.190 --> 29:25.750
but not the whole.

29:26.620 --> 29:30.356
Although Wen Cong is your senior,

29:30.380 --> 29:33.070
he's very ruthless.

29:33.770 --> 29:36.946
He insisted on defeating all merchants in Nandu

29:36.970 --> 29:38.890
so that he could corner the market.

29:40.590 --> 29:41.676
Mr. Yun,

29:41.700 --> 29:44.806
I heard that Yuntai always sees it as your task to protect the people.

29:44.830 --> 29:48.126
But didn't Wen Cong's doings

29:48.150 --> 29:49.986
violate your rules?

29:50.010 --> 29:52.156
Mr. Wen must have his own reason to do so.

29:52.180 --> 29:56.110
Do you mean the Su family should just await our doom?

29:59.870 --> 30:02.250
On April 20, the 24th year of Tianqing.

30:00.700 --> 30:02.810
[Land Ownership Certificate]

30:03.310 --> 30:05.110
This is to certify that the following person has purchased a 120-acre land,

30:05.110 --> 30:07.670
located at Qingfengpu on the east coast,

30:08.410 --> 30:11.740
which costs 1,600 taels of silver in total and the transaction is completed.

30:11.940 --> 30:13.420
Su Linghe.

30:16.070 --> 30:17.870
It's the name of my late father.

30:18.550 --> 30:21.600
On May 4, the 24th year of Tianqing,

30:20.660 --> 30:22.196
[Land Ownership Certificate]

30:21.770 --> 30:24.236
your father sold the land

30:24.260 --> 30:26.140
to Liu Qi.

30:26.360 --> 30:28.516
Liu Qi is also the owner of Zhaixing House.

30:28.540 --> 30:30.190
According to Mr. Su,

30:30.540 --> 30:32.236
your families have been friends for generations.

30:30.860 --> 30:33.640
[Su]

30:32.260 --> 30:34.870
On June 11, the 24th year of Tianqing,

30:35.180 --> 30:38.346
Liu Qi sold the land property to Mr. Wen

30:36.270 --> 30:37.720
[Land Ownership Certificate]

30:38.370 --> 30:40.866
at a high price of 5,200 taels.

30:40.890 --> 30:44.960
The land property was sold twice within two months.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.706
And the price tripled.

30:46.730 --> 30:48.926
In this case, there is only one reason for that.

30:48.950 --> 30:50.780
Your father spread the rumour

30:50.800 --> 30:53.976
that the Imperial Court would unban the maritime trade on the east coast.

30:54.000 --> 30:55.646
Then he quickly bought

30:55.670 --> 30:58.116
a lot of land on the east coast at a low price.

30:58.140 --> 31:00.336
When Mr. Wen took action,

31:00.360 --> 31:02.456
most of the properties along the coast had been purchased.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.476
Under the circumstances,

31:03.500 --> 31:06.760
he could only purchase the property from other merchants at a higher price

31:06.910 --> 31:08.956
and hoped that land prices would keep rising.

31:08.980 --> 31:10.546
So that he could get rid of it.

31:10.570 --> 31:12.456
But during the spring of the next year,

31:12.480 --> 31:15.066
the rumour about unbanning the maritime trade was no more tenable.

31:15.090 --> 31:16.860
The land prices dropped drastically.

31:16.910 --> 31:18.470
I did a rough calculation.

31:18.630 --> 31:22.636
Mr. Wen lost about 200,000 taels in the incident.

31:22.660 --> 31:24.170
After that incident,

31:24.830 --> 31:26.870
he can no longer corner the market in Nandu

31:26.870 --> 31:28.990
on his own.

31:29.660 --> 31:33.710
But your Su family became famous because of that.

31:34.100 --> 31:35.670
Your father

31:35.780 --> 31:39.100
even secured his position of being the Nandu Chamber of Commerce's chairman.

31:40.700 --> 31:43.510
I won't deny what you said.

31:52.040 --> 31:53.006
Mr. Qian.

31:53.030 --> 31:55.046
The lady hasn't eaten anything yet.

31:55.070 --> 31:56.106
It's noon already.

31:56.130 --> 31:58.526
She'll get sick if she doesn't eat anything.

31:58.550 --> 31:59.846
You may leave first.

31:59.870 --> 32:01.320
Yes.

32:08.910 --> 32:12.190
If Mr. Yun came back for revenge,

32:15.090 --> 32:18.300
it'd be enough to punish someone and give a warning to others.

32:18.720 --> 32:20.170
To punish who?

32:23.390 --> 32:24.840
You?

32:26.270 --> 32:28.070
Chairman Su,

32:28.660 --> 32:30.840
are you trying to repent or threaten?

32:38.820 --> 32:41.070
I've admitted everything I should.

32:44.010 --> 32:46.046
It's inevitable that we neglected something.

32:46.070 --> 32:48.080
Let me help you recall.

32:51.250 --> 32:54.020
On September 13, the 24th year of Tianqing,

32:54.300 --> 32:56.536
Tang Xiao bought a 207-acre land

32:56.560 --> 32:59.456
from Jiangnan Administration Bureau.

32:59.480 --> 33:00.960
On the third day of October,

33:01.170 --> 33:03.576
he sold the property to Mr. Wen.

33:03.600 --> 33:05.640
Chairman Su, do you remember?

33:05.700 --> 33:10.216
Back then, we only bought one real estate from Jiangnan Administration Bureau,

33:10.240 --> 33:11.306
which was the Luo family's village.

33:11.330 --> 33:15.720
It was exactly Tang Xiao and Luo family's village

33:16.500 --> 33:18.010
that you never spoke a word about.

33:18.440 --> 33:22.490
It's written clearly on the land ownership certificate.

33:22.740 --> 33:25.646
The deal was between Tang Xiao and Wen Cong.

33:25.670 --> 33:28.110
It had nothing to do with the Su family.

33:29.000 --> 33:32.836
Your father spread the rumour about the Imperial Court unbanning the maritime trade

33:32.860 --> 33:34.776
and caused chaos in purchasing land on the east coast.

33:34.800 --> 33:37.690
But your father didn't intend to defeat Mr. Wen,

33:38.310 --> 33:39.350
but to make Mr. Wen

33:39.350 --> 33:42.166
have no more chance to make a comeback in Nandu.

33:42.190 --> 33:44.180
So in the second half of the game,

33:44.700 --> 33:47.850
Tang Xiao became the best pawn.

33:47.900 --> 33:49.526
At that time, coastal estates on the east coast

33:49.550 --> 33:51.966
were traded frequently among merchants in Nandu.

33:51.990 --> 33:53.456
But not even a few land ownership certificates

33:53.480 --> 33:55.870
was with the name of Tang Xiao.

33:56.150 --> 33:58.110
That caused the false appearance of

33:58.110 --> 34:00.066
Tang Xiao having no agreement with the Su family.

34:00.090 --> 34:02.506
That's why Mr. Wen let his guard down

34:02.530 --> 34:03.866
and dared to cooperate with Tang Xiao.

34:03.890 --> 34:05.340
Mr. Yun,

34:06.120 --> 34:07.660
I'll say it again.

34:07.870 --> 34:10.626
Tang Xiao has nothing to do with our Su family.

34:10.650 --> 34:14.800
Next is the most brilliant

34:15.580 --> 34:17.545
and the most vicious trick of your father.

34:17.569 --> 34:20.616
There wasn't much real estate on the east coast.

34:20.640 --> 34:23.189
The isolated Luo family's village was one of them.

34:24.460 --> 34:26.315
Mr. Wen ordered Qi Tianfeng to purchase it.

34:26.339 --> 34:27.890
But then,

34:28.060 --> 34:30.406
someone proposed a plan to Mr. Wen,

34:30.430 --> 34:32.056
saying that if he falsely accused the people,

34:32.080 --> 34:34.300
he could bribe the soldiers to slaughter the villagers.

34:34.510 --> 34:37.550
So that he could cut the cost of purchasing land.

34:37.810 --> 34:42.450
That's how the murder of the Luo family's village happened.

34:43.710 --> 34:46.180
And the person who came up with the plan

34:47.520 --> 34:48.979
was Tang Xiao.

34:49.270 --> 34:52.896
Tang Xiao was just the owner of a gambling house.

34:52.920 --> 34:54.605
Even if he could

34:54.629 --> 34:57.236
bribe Sheriff Liu and other soldiers to kill the villagers,

34:57.260 --> 34:59.766
there was no way he could control the Imperial Court's order

34:59.790 --> 35:02.526
and deploy them to the frontline of Fujian to eliminate the pirates.

35:02.550 --> 35:03.666
Actually, it was to silence them.

35:03.690 --> 35:05.770
But on the contrary, the Su family

35:05.830 --> 35:07.986
had so much correlation with the Imperial Court.

35:08.010 --> 35:09.870
It was a piece of cake

35:10.220 --> 35:12.156
for you to do so.

35:12.180 --> 35:14.250
The truth is obvious to be known.

35:14.820 --> 35:16.730
Do I need to explain further?

35:17.040 --> 35:19.120
What is the truth

35:19.970 --> 35:21.326
you're referring to?

35:21.350 --> 35:22.930
The truth is

35:23.990 --> 35:25.726
Mr. Wen was set up

35:25.750 --> 35:27.356
and destroyed step by step.

35:27.380 --> 35:31.220
In the end, he broke the rules of our sect and became greedy.

35:31.670 --> 35:33.246
He also took the blame

35:33.270 --> 35:35.450
for the murder of the Luo family's village alone.

35:36.550 --> 35:39.246
He could only watch the Su family take over the Chamber of Commerce

35:39.270 --> 35:41.260
and establish your foundation step by step.

35:42.740 --> 35:45.380
As the mastermind behind all of this,

35:46.590 --> 35:49.206
your father behaved in such an inhumane manner.

35:49.230 --> 35:52.300
Wasn't he afraid of being slapped by evil spirits in the middle of the night?

35:53.050 --> 35:54.900
Don't insult my father.

36:01.460 --> 36:03.260
Since you entered the city,

36:03.520 --> 36:05.610
I've always been kind to you.

36:05.900 --> 36:07.900
Don't push your luck

36:07.990 --> 36:10.220
and mistake me for being weak.

36:10.580 --> 36:12.110
All the evidence

36:13.840 --> 36:16.040
is in front of you.

36:16.100 --> 36:18.740
Who benefited the most in the game?

36:19.000 --> 36:20.940
It could only be the Su family

36:21.700 --> 36:23.850
which is so influential that you can lose your conscience.

36:26.520 --> 36:27.970
Xiang,

36:28.180 --> 36:31.260
I think you're done with the Su family.

36:31.510 --> 36:32.960
Please take your leave.

36:46.140 --> 36:47.630
Who are you?

36:51.990 --> 36:53.500
You can guess the answer.

37:07.150 --> 37:10.270
Even if the Yuntai Sect is impeccable,

37:10.950 --> 37:11.896
after all,

37:11.920 --> 37:14.620
it's just a shady sect.

37:15.020 --> 37:17.326
If there's one day we have a deadly duel,

37:17.350 --> 37:20.040
I'll find a way to deal with them.

37:22.870 --> 37:24.820
He's not from Yuntai.

37:26.510 --> 37:28.330
He is from Luo's family village.

37:39.820 --> 37:40.546
Xiaoyu,

37:40.570 --> 37:41.506
when I grow up,

37:41.530 --> 37:43.750
will I be as pretty as Miss Ke?

37:43.930 --> 37:45.186
No, you won't.

37:45.210 --> 37:46.726
Even so, I'm still prettier than you.

37:46.750 --> 37:48.646
I don't care.

37:48.670 --> 37:50.320
When I grow up,

37:50.430 --> 37:53.046
I want to be a heroine like Miss Shu.

37:53.070 --> 37:54.640
I don't need to be pretty.

37:56.150 --> 37:58.430
You two go elsewhere to play.

38:05.490 --> 38:07.620
Do you like kids very much?

38:08.860 --> 38:10.716
Children are naive.

38:10.740 --> 38:12.300
Everyone likes them.

38:13.260 --> 38:16.596
But these two girls are so cunning.

38:16.620 --> 38:19.096
I'm afraid they'll have bad habits

38:19.120 --> 38:21.250
if they stay in Liansheng House for too long.

38:22.630 --> 38:24.670
It's indeed not a long-term solution.

38:27.180 --> 38:29.100
I've discussed this with Mingyu.

38:29.820 --> 38:32.820
The Su family still has an old house left unoccupied.

38:33.030 --> 38:36.120
We plan to turn it into a charity hall.

38:36.880 --> 38:38.350
That's great.

38:41.310 --> 38:44.186
You always call him Mr. Su.

38:44.210 --> 38:46.150
When did you start to call him Mingyu?

38:48.770 --> 38:49.956
Tell me.

38:49.980 --> 38:52.440
Are you two engaged in marriage without permission from your parents?

38:56.910 --> 38:59.660
Su Mingyu is indeed reliable.

38:59.870 --> 39:00.866
If he dares to betray you,

39:00.890 --> 39:02.600
I'll break his legs.

39:05.590 --> 39:07.300
Although I am reluctant for that,

39:07.350 --> 39:10.290
we are family after this.

39:11.880 --> 39:13.330
How about this?

39:14.190 --> 39:15.950
Nothing here suits me.

39:16.270 --> 39:18.550
No wonder men like you.

39:18.670 --> 39:20.206
Even the kids say

39:20.230 --> 39:21.830
I don't look like a girl.

39:23.520 --> 39:25.556
Don't you have Mr. Yun?

39:25.580 --> 39:27.030
He...

39:27.290 --> 39:30.810
He didn't even inform me when he went out last night.

39:31.300 --> 39:33.690
I still have no idea about where he is.

39:34.040 --> 39:36.810
Your thoughts are still full of Mr. Yun every day.

39:39.830 --> 39:43.610
Maybe you like him being that.

39:44.980 --> 39:46.430
Maybe.

39:46.770 --> 39:49.970
He is like a kite.

39:50.380 --> 39:52.800
If he landed on the ground,

39:52.840 --> 39:54.290
there would be no point in that.

39:57.300 --> 40:00.900
It's fine as long as the kite string

40:00.950 --> 40:03.570
is always in your hands.

40:06.190 --> 40:07.640
How about this?

40:12.900 --> 40:14.350
Why don't I just take this?

40:15.600 --> 40:17.050
No way.

40:18.720 --> 40:20.170
This one.

40:20.420 --> 40:22.450
It's elegant and neat.

40:23.230 --> 40:25.420
Okay, I'll listen to you.

40:25.900 --> 40:27.350
Okay.

40:29.410 --> 40:31.036
The hairpin still doesn't work for me.

40:31.060 --> 40:32.996
The silver colour shines at night.

40:33.020 --> 40:34.500
It's so obvious that my whereabouts will be revealed.

40:35.220 --> 40:38.030
Miss Shu, you aren't fighting all the time.

40:38.570 --> 40:40.020
Miss.

40:41.690 --> 40:43.366
The city gate is closed.

40:43.390 --> 40:45.836
The vendors can't get in and the market is closed too.

40:45.860 --> 40:48.406
I went out just now and couldn't buy anything.

40:48.430 --> 40:49.636
The city is having a lockdown?

40:49.660 --> 40:50.686
Why?

40:50.710 --> 40:51.896
I don't know.

40:51.920 --> 40:54.406
I just heard that some soldiers had gathered at the city gate.

40:54.430 --> 40:55.310
When I came back,

40:55.310 --> 40:57.390
I saw many patrolmen patrolling the streets.

40:58.310 --> 40:59.316
We still have enough ingredients.

40:59.340 --> 41:00.790
Let's go tomorrow.

41:00.950 --> 41:02.400
Where is Ten Taels of Gold?

41:03.400 --> 41:04.850
No idea.

41:08.670 --> 41:10.610
We tried to match them together with good intentions.

41:10.750 --> 41:12.670
But it turned out to be our wishful thinking.

41:13.370 --> 41:16.796
Is this the first time Jin has been liked by a girl?

41:16.820 --> 41:18.026
He needs to get used to it.

41:18.050 --> 41:19.516
Is this his first time?

41:19.540 --> 41:21.180
How would I know?

41:22.870 --> 41:24.320
Is Yun Xiang back?

41:25.080 --> 41:26.106
Where's Su Mingyu?

41:26.130 --> 41:27.126
He went to the Weaving Division

41:27.150 --> 41:28.600
for the tributary cloth.

41:29.090 --> 41:30.356
Tang Xiao has sent the money here.

41:30.380 --> 41:31.830
Let's go and pick it up.

41:40.470 --> 41:41.886
Why are you standing there?

41:41.910 --> 41:43.360
Are you reluctant to do so?

41:49.260 --> 41:50.710
Wait.

41:56.450 --> 41:58.770
The money from the Tang's Gambling House

41:59.340 --> 42:01.770
should be sent to Guanghui Bank first.

42:04.340 --> 42:05.486
It doesn't matter.

42:05.510 --> 42:07.086
Since the money is here,

42:07.110 --> 42:08.246
let's keep it for now.

42:08.270 --> 42:10.456
We'll deal with it when Yun Xiang comes back.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.616
That's right.

42:11.640 --> 42:13.680
Mr. Yun will handle it.

42:14.030 --> 42:16.670
Miss, please don't make it difficult for us, the servants.

42:31.870 --> 42:33.320
Wait.

42:34.150 --> 42:35.366
Miss.

42:35.390 --> 42:36.990
Did I say anything wrong?

42:38.310 --> 42:39.766
Who is this hooligan?

42:39.790 --> 42:41.440
Stay away from Liansheng House.

42:41.540 --> 42:42.646
Girl.

42:42.670 --> 42:44.120
What happened?

42:46.200 --> 42:48.760
She has a bad temper.

42:48.940 --> 42:52.516
People might think I'm not giving her money

42:52.540 --> 42:54.540
but something dirty.

42:54.700 --> 42:56.980
Liansheng House doesn't accept the money.

43:01.790 --> 43:02.996
Girl...

43:03.020 --> 43:04.286
Don't argue with me about this.

43:04.310 --> 43:06.780
I'll explain this to Yun Xiang when he is back.

43:07.630 --> 43:09.480
Miss.

43:09.790 --> 43:11.590
I'm curious about

43:11.680 --> 43:13.390
how you will explain it.

43:20.470 --> 43:22.440
If you stay any longer,

43:23.110 --> 43:24.880
you'll suffer the consequences.

43:25.180 --> 43:27.950
Fine, I'll leave.

43:28.270 --> 43:29.720
Let's go.

43:44.540 --> 43:47.310
Miss Shu, do you know this servant?

43:48.270 --> 43:49.606
Tang Xiao is very cunning.

43:49.630 --> 43:51.510
Don't get yourself into trouble.

44:48.230 --> 44:51.230
What do you want to do in Nandu?

44:53.930 --> 44:57.020
Long time no see, sister.
